          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "mergulho comes from mergulhar \"to dive\", which is usually traced to a Vulgar Latin form built on Latin mergere \"to plunge, to dip\" (Lewis & Short)."
            }
          ]
        },
